++ * alphaplus early boot probes: where the timed reset is placed.
++ *
++ * Once the MMU is on the frame buffer is not mapped, so the signal is time:
++ * the CPU waits ALPHA_PROBE_RESET_SECONDS and then calls PSCI SYSTEM_RESET.
++ * A reboot after that delay means the boot got to the selected point.
++ * Exactly one point is active; 0 disables the reset.
